  "descriptions": {
    "zh": "## 请求说明\n- 本接口专为网关用户设计，允许他们更新指定域名的状态属性。\n- 必须提供`OperatorType`，`OperatorId`，`DomainName`参数以标识要修改的具体网关下的特定域名的状态。\n- 可选参数包括`AddStatusList`，`DeleteStatusList`，包含`Status`和`StatusMsg`这些用来标识需要增加或者删除的域名状态。",
    "en": "## Description\n\n- This API operation allows gateway users to update the status of a specified domain name.\n\n- You must specify the `OperatorType`, `OperatorId`, and `DomainName` parameters to identify the domain name and gateway for the update.\n\n- You can use the optional `AddStatusList` and `DeleteStatusList` parameters to specify the domain name statuses to add or delete. These parameters contain `Status` and `StatusMsg`."
